2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.myheritage.dk/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-slaegtstraeer?itemId=134009241-1-500328&action=showRecord:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.myheritage.dk/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-slaegtstraeer?itemId=153852241-1-512530&action=showRecord
