1 OCCU 1474 Baccalaureus, 1475 Degn i Roskilde, 1478 Provst i Børglum og Rigsrσd, 1480 Electus og 1487 Biskop i Børglum
1 TITL Biskop
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Bishop Niels Stygge Rosenkrantz=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Anders Nielsen Stygge Rosenkrantz and Berete Eilersdatter Rønnow
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://biografiskleksikon.lex.dk/Niels_Stygge_Rosenkrantz Niels Stygge Rosenkrantz]
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels Stygge Rosenkrantz, Niels Styggesen Rosenkrantz , d. .1533, bishop. Died in Børglum k. R. was matriculated in Greifswald in 1473, baccalaureate in 1474, provost in Børglum and as such a member of the council of the kingdom, 
2 CONC electus in 1480 and bishop in Børglum in 1487, was ordained in 1519 to his nephew Stygge Krumpen as coadjutor and was himself again endowed with Børglum monastery as provost. The Skiby Chronicle gives a description of R's worldly 
2 CONC disposition and unworthy life: when he became bishop he gave up all monasticism and all spiritual life; his whole life, right up to his old age, he spent with games and play, merry pranks, cards and dice and with turning arrows, w
2 CONC hich amused him a lot; otherwise he was never happy except when he was surrounded by noble lovers or by pranksters, jesters and flatterers. He was even expelled from the council of the kingdom once for dishonorable conviction and 
2 CONC was only barely readmitted after having had to pay a large fine (a case whose true context is unknown). The Skiby Chronicle also depicts him as a man who only used the episcopate to enrich himself. - R. belonged in 1513 to the par
2 CONC ty that sought to prevent Christian II's accession to the throne, and later became one of the leaders in the rebellion against Christian II. The year before his death he received a promise from Frederick I to become bishop of Børg
2 CONC lum again when Stygge Krumpen died.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Parents: Anders Nielsen Stygge of Hevringholm (died no earlier than 1478) and Birgitte Eilersdatter Rønnow.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ikonografi '''Relief på ligsten fra før 1500''' (Børglum kloster)......
2 CONT
2 CONT **
2 CONT
2 CONT Ejstrupgaard, Morsø:  1486-1519	Niels	Styggesen	Rosenkrantz	_____-1533
2 CONT
2 CONT Sindbjergaard, Morsø: 1486-1519	Niels	Styggesen	Rosenkrantz
