2 CONT
2 CONT '''Kilder''' 	
2 CONT * [S2] Danmarks Adels Aarbog, Thiset, Hiort-Lorenzen, Bobé, Teisen., (Dansk Adelsforening), [1884 - 2005]., DAA 1905:294.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I17972&tree=2
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''NN Johannesdatter Munk'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Born:	after circa 1280 Sønder Elkær, Sulsted Sogn, Kær Herred, Ålborg Amt, Nordjylland, Danmark 
2 CONT * Dead:	after 1317 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Johannes Palnesen Munk and Gunner Aagesdatter, til Sønder Elkjær 
