2 CONT * Writings in the Kiöbenhavnske Selskab af Lærdoms och Videnskabs Elskere fremlagte og oplæste (Copenhagen 1745), 7:315 
2 CONT * Dipl. Dal. No. 3 (by Langebek) Printed regest
2 CONT * Norberg through 600 years (1958), p. 155 
2 CONT * H. Schück, Rikets brev og register (1976), p. 46 no. 30 (see also p. 53)
2 CONT * Photo in Norberg through 600 years (1958), after p. 156.
2 CONT * Literature and commentary
2 CONT * On Tuna see KA Holmberg, De svenska Tuna-namnen (1969), p. 238 with note 2.
2 CONT * On Torkel Knutsson's land holdings, see Bjarne Beckman, Matts Kättilmundsson og hans tid, part 1 (1953), pp. 338f.
2 CONT
