1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Pernille Mogensdatter Gøye''' was born in 1506 in Krenkerup, Radsted, Maribo, Danmark. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-30360038 Mogens Eskildsen Gøye til Krenkerup, Torbenfeld, Clausholm, Løgismose m.m.] and [htt
2 CONC ps://www.geni.com/profile-25467039 Mette Bydelsbak]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pernille married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34620381603 Anders Ebbesen Galt] circa 1525. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pernille married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34620382053 Børge Trolle] in 1539. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on March 5, 1552. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- Pernille Gøye, born 1506, died 5.3.1552 was married first time with Anders Ebbesen Galt (dead 1529) second time to Børge Trolle (1501-1571)
2 CONT
2 CONT Pernille Gøye is mentioned here: http://denstoredanske.dk/Dansk_Biografisk_Leksikon/Samfund,_jura_og_politik/Myndigheder_og_politisk_styre/Rigsråd/Børge_Trolle
