1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of Claus der aeltere von Grabow zu Grabow, who was still alive in 1581.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joachim Grabow blev født cirka 1510 i Wutike, Brandenburg, Tyskland. Joachim blev gift cirka 1546 i Brandenburg, Tyskland, med Else von Bretsken.
2 CONT
2 CONT De fik soennen Hans Grabow f. c 1549, d. 1625-26
2 CONT
2 CONT Jochim Died before 1594.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mentioned in the Brandenburger Archiv in Potsdam.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Grabow family owned estate in Ost Priegnitz ca 60 KM NW of Berlin and was known in 1300s.
